                      {
                        "component": "Markdown",
                        "props": { "headingOffset": 2 },
                        "children": [
                          "The ledger sizes its database connection pool from `LEDGER_POOL_MAX`, read **once, at start-up**. A change meant for the staging overlay was applied to production, lowering the pool to 20.\n\nUnder Tuesday-morning load the ledger needs roughly 140 connections. Authorisations queued behind the pool and timed out after 30 seconds, which the checkout service reported to shoppers as *Payment failed*.\n\n### Why the rollback did not help\n\nRolling back restored the configuration but not the running pool. The fix only took effect after the rolling restart at 10:22."
                        ]
                      },
